  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northern Caribbean Disaster Response Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Atlas works on the ground post disasters to provide immediate assistance for farmers to re-establish the food supply chain and increase food security and restore livelihoods. Our focus is to rebuild a strong and sustainable food system.  Through our programs:  1. Scaling up Local Ag (SULA) Grant, we provide small to medium size grants to rebuild, repair or replace.  2. Our SULA Fund will allow farmers to scale up to commercial production capacity. 3. Build a climate smart ag training center</narrative>
  </description>
